spigot
------------------------------------------
Spigot is a command-line streaming exact real calculator.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgmp10-6.3.0-1
  libncursesw10-6.5+20240427-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  halibut-1.3-1bl3
  libgmp-devel-6.3.0-1
  libncurses-devel-6.5+20240427-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/spigot/

Canonical download:
  https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/spigot/spigot-20261009.b2c2295.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack spigot-20261009-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./spigot-20261009-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/spigot-20261009-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/spigot-20261009-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(spigot)
  /usr/bin/spigot.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/spigot.README
  /usr/share/doc/spigot/LICENCE
  /usr/share/doc/spigot/TODO.txt
  /usr/share/doc/spigot/spigot.html
  /usr/share/man/man1/spigot.1.gz

